From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 21:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the system control block

The system control block of the A733 sits at 0x03000000 (4 KiB) in the
user manual's memory map. Describe it, so that devices can reach its
registers through the system control driver.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the system control node
binds and hands the calibration registers to the USB2 PHY.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index f05a5c584006..3f3d90cd4041 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -520,6 +520,14 @@ ths: thermal-sensor@2522000 {
 			#thermal-sensor-cells = <1>;
 		};
 
+		syscon: syscon@3000000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-system-control";
+			reg = <0x03000000 0x1000>;
+			#address-cells = <1>;
+			#size-cells = <1>;
+			ranges;
+		};
+
 		sid: efuse@3006000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-sid",
 				     "allwinner,sun50i-a64-sid";
